# PartyLeaderSplit (22088, silhouette 20003; the far npc line only gives the silhouette its
# template): a magic skill's hit splits nothing; the first hit of a physical skill (Unlock, 27)
# raises six silhouettes around it as its privates, each with the spawn parameters 1000, the
# attacker, 0, and takes the leader out of the world. Its created hook is not the Warrior one:
# the ShoutMsg1 it carries is not said.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.PartyLeaderSplit
npc split 22088 Monster 300 0 0 ai silhouette=20003,ShoutMsg1=1000403
npc sil 20003 Monster 5000 0 0

hit split 10 skill 1177 1
  privates split -
  inworld split yes
hit split 10 skill 27 1
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S ChangeMoveType obj=sil running=1 swimming=0
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S ChangeMoveType obj=sil running=1 swimming=0
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S ChangeMoveType obj=sil running=1 swimming=0
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S ChangeMoveType obj=sil running=1 swimming=0
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S ChangeMoveType obj=sil running=1 swimming=0
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S ChangeMoveType obj=sil running=1 swimming=0
  S NpcInfo obj=sil npc=20003
  S DeleteObject obj=split
  inworld split no
  live 20003 7
